1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,236
Doctors grew an EAR

2
00:00:01,276 --> 00:00:03,076
inside this woman’s FOREARM.

3
00:00:03,116 --> 00:00:04,561
She lost her ear in a crash,

4
00:00:04,601 --> 00:00:06,281
so surgeons carved a replacement

5
00:00:06,321 --> 00:00:07,856
from her own rib cartilage.

6
00:00:07,896 --> 00:00:09,346
They tucked it beneath her arm skin,

7
00:00:09,386 --> 00:00:11,406
where new blood vessels formed around it.

8
00:00:11,446 --> 00:00:12,001
Months later,

9
00:00:12,041 --> 00:00:14,016
they moved the living ear to her head,

10
00:00:14,056 --> 00:00:16,216
reconnecting its blood supply and nerves.

11
00:00:16,256 --> 00:00:17,336
And for MONTHS…

12
00:00:17,376 --> 00:00:19,456
her new ear was right HERE.

